      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاجَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَحِيجُ</span>, (Kr, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَيْجٌ</span>,
(TA,) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاجَ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَحُوجُ</span>: (Kr, K:) extr.,
